      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/5890be57781831be7951ccf225f7f2cf.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is no ordinary high school. Ghosts fill the art department, cultists meet below the monkey bars and now crocodiles are eating children. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with a magical Kraken to save the school (and the world) from the dastardly deeds of the Traitor, a malevolent mastermind who could be anyone on the campus grounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/a6e701e1eef34e8f1eed181d3170fcb9.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While saving the world is definitely an important goal there’s a whole range of other activities to dive into. With the help of a magical amulet bestowed upon you by the Kraken, you can play with time to learn teachers’ and students’ routines, and explore every corner of the campus. Attend a costume party, become a detective, and help the school’s janitor bring down a crime syndicate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/213158a16bf6ccae3e7428979568c657.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is split into four clubs: Music, Art, Sports and Drama:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎸 Join the alternative Music Club and complete the school’s edgiest rock band.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Flex your creative flair in the Art Club and show off your work at an exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏅 Compete in challenges to become the ultimate warrior in the Sports Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 The Drama Club may be full of snobs, but if you can't beat 'em, join em! Who knows, you may even become a star in their next extravagant play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky for you, your amulet will let you join them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/820529994bacfb40a454dacbe291f092.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is a melting pot of wacky personalities. In the Music Club alone you will meet pretty boy and lead vocalist, Vladimir, who struggles with keeping his hysterical fangirls at bay; ill-tempered bassist, Simona, always seen in her giraffe hoodie, who hates everyone (including you); and Broccoli Girl, the drummer, who just can’t get over her ex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So come on! Grab your uniform, lunch money, magical amulet and ignore the voice in your head that says this is a terrible idea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/5890be57781831be7951ccf225f7f2cf.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is no ordinary high school. Ghosts fill the art department, cultists meet below the monkey bars and now crocodiles are eating children. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/f5ceeebb7a7413ab55e50f3d9a20e021.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with a magical Kraken to save the school (and the world) from the dastardly deeds of the Traitor, a malevolent mastermind who could be anyone on the campus grounds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/a6e701e1eef34e8f1eed181d3170fcb9.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While saving the world is definitely an important goal there’s a whole range of other activities to dive into. With the help of a magical amulet bestowed upon you by the Kraken, you can play with time to learn teachers’ and students’ routines, and explore every corner of the campus. Attend a costume party, become a detective, and help the school’s janitor bring down a crime syndicate. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/ba0acf12e801baedcdea4150dda2a8c0.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/213158a16bf6ccae3e7428979568c657.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is split into four clubs: Music, Art, Sports and Drama:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎸 Join the alternative Music Club and complete the school’s edgiest rock band.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Flex your creative flair in the Art Club and show off your work at an exhibition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏅 Compete in challenges to become the ultimate warrior in the Sports Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎭 The Drama Club may be full of snobs, but if you can't beat 'em, join em! Who knows, you may even become a star in their next extravagant play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky for you, your amulet will let you join them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/335badd1ea8fdc409280425e526abb13.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/820529994bacfb40a454dacbe291f092.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kraken Academy is a melting pot of wacky personalities. In the Music Club alone you will meet pretty boy and lead vocalist, Vladimir, who struggles with keeping his hysterical fangirls at bay; ill-tempered bassist, Simona, always seen in her giraffe hoodie, who hates everyone (including you); and Broccoli Girl, the drummer, who just can’t get over her ex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e6fa318db72a94535b924e5cb019907d.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So come on! Grab your uniform, lunch money, magical amulet and ignore the voice in your head that says this is a terrible idea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.poster.avif?t=1761646109\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.webm?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158220/extras/e4c21c55f369d35a9b1be9a7dc8d81d3.mp4?t=1761646109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
      "short_description": "Make friends, free spirits and make sure that the world doesn’t end! Welcome to Kraken Academy, a technicolor fever dream that for legal reasons can only be described as &quot;technically a school.&quot; Join forces with a magical kraken to save the world!",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“The sharp writing has made me laugh out loud on more than one occasion, and I’m enjoying getting to know these weirdos through sidequests and even dates.”<br>Game Informer<br><br>“Kraken Academy!! is a heartwarming, outrageously hilarious and at times poignant adventure through time... I simply cannot recommend Kraken Academy!! enough.”<br>9.5/10 – The Game Crater<br><br>“Kraken Academy was so much fun and was an enjoyable experience from start to finish... Overall, I loved, loved, loved this game.”<br>9.3/10 – Lv1 Gaming<br>",
